---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro'
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy — Marketing Performance Group"
  description="How Marketing Performance Group collects, uses, and shares information from visitors to marketingperformance.net, including disclosures for analytics, advertising, and identity resolution technology."
>
  <nav class="mp-nav">
    <div class="mp-nav-inner">
      <a href="/" class="mp-logo">
        <img src="/mp-logo-v3.png" alt="Marketing Performance — Powered by EngageEngine™" width="217" height="44" />
      </a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="legal">
    <article class="legal-doc">
      <header class="legal-head">
        <p class="legal-eye">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="legal-h1">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal-dates">
          <span><strong>Effective Date:</strong> May 27, 2026</span>
          <span><strong>Last Updated:</strong> May 27, 2026</span>
        </p>
      </header>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <p>Marketing Performance Group ("we," "us," or "our") operates marketingperformance.net (the "Site"). This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and share information about you when you visit the Site or interact with our services. By using the Site, you agree to the practices described here.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>

        <h3>Information You Provide</h3>
        <p>When you fill out a form on the Site — the Market Snapshot, the Free Diagnostic, the Free Toolkit request, or any contact form — we collect the information you submit, which may include:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your name</li>
          <li>Your business name and website</li>
          <li>Your email address and phone number</li>
          <li>Your service area and the services your business provides</li>
          <li>Any other information you choose to share</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Information Collected Automatically</h3>
        <p>When you visit the Site, we and our service providers automatically collect:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>IP address and approximate geographic location (city, state) derived from your IP</li>
          <li>Device, browser, and operating system information</li>
          <li>Pages viewed, referring URLs, and links clicked</li>
          <li>Session recordings and behavioral signals (via Microsoft Clarity)</li>
          <li>Cookie and pixel data from our analytics and advertising providers</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Identity Resolution</h3>
        <p>We use <strong>identity resolution technology</strong> to associate anonymous Site visitor signals with identifiable contact data. This means that even if you do not fill out a form, third-party identity resolution providers may match your IP address, device fingerprint, or other available signals against their first-party datasets and provide us with your name, business affiliation, email address, mailing address, or other contact details. We use this information for the purposes described in Section 2.</p>
        <p>If you do not want your visit to be subject to identity resolution, see Section 5 ("Your Choices and Rights").</p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>2. How We Use Information</h2>
        <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Provide and operate the Site and our services</li>
          <li>Respond to your inquiries and provide requested deliverables (snapshots, diagnostics, toolkits)</li>
          <li>Send marketing and follow-up communications about our services</li>
          <li>Build, refine, and target advertising audiences across Google, Meta, and other ad platforms</li>
          <li>Measure the effectiveness of our marketing and Site performance</li>
          <li>Comply with legal obligations and protect our rights</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>3. How We Share Information</h2>
        <p>We share information with the following categories of recipients:</p>

        <h3>Service Providers</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Google</strong> (Google Analytics, Google Ads) — site analytics and advertising</li>
          <li><strong>Meta</strong> (Facebook / Instagram) — advertising and conversion tracking</li>
          <li><strong>Microsoft</strong> (Clarity) — session recordings and behavioral analytics</li>
          <li><strong>Identity Resolution Providers</strong> (including services such as idpixel.app) — resolving visitor signals to identifiable contact data</li>
          <li><strong>Form and email providers</strong> (Formspree and similar) — form delivery and email communications</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Business Transfers</h3>
        <p>If we are involved in a merger, acquisition, or sale of assets, your information may be transferred as part of that transaction.</p>

        <h3>Legal</h3>
        <p>We may disclose information to comply with law, respond to lawful requests, or protect the safety, rights, or property of our company, our clients, or others.</p>

        <p class="legal-callout"><strong>Under certain U.S. state privacy laws, our use of identity resolution and advertising cookies may constitute a "sale" or "sharing" of personal information. You have the right to opt out — see Section 5.</strong></p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>4. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
        <p>We use cookies, pixels, and similar technologies including:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Google Analytics 4</strong> (<code>G-7CF3328ZK0</code>) — site analytics</li>
          <li><strong>Microsoft Clarity</strong> (<code>v5zy2jqg2w</code>) — session recordings and heatmaps</li>
          <li><strong>Meta Pixel</strong> (<code>1362717861424529</code>) — advertising and conversion tracking</li>
          <li><strong>Identity Resolution Pixel</strong> (idpixel.app) — visitor identification</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Most browsers let you control cookies through their settings. Disabling cookies may affect Site functionality.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>5. Your Choices and Rights</h2>

        <h3>Opt Out of Identity Resolution and Advertising</h3>
        <p>To opt out of identity resolution, marketing emails, and personalized advertising on this Site, email <a href="mailto:robert@marketingperformance.net?subject=Privacy%20Opt-Out">robert@marketingperformance.net</a> with the subject line "Privacy Opt-Out." Include your name, email address, and any other contact information we may have on file. We will process your request within 30 days.</p>

        <p>You may also use these third-party opt-out tools:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Google Analytics: <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout</a></li>
          <li>Meta interest-based advertising: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/help/568137493302217" target="_blank" rel="noopener">facebook.com/help/568137493302217</a></li>
          <li>Industry opt-out: <a href="https://optout.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener">optout.aboutads.info</a> and <a href="https://optout.networkadvertising.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">optout.networkadvertising.org</a></li>
        </ul>

        <p>We honor the <strong>Global Privacy Control (GPC)</strong> signal sent by your browser as a valid opt-out request.</p>

        <h3>State Privacy Rights (CA, VA, CO, CT, UT, and others)</h3>
        <p>If you are a resident of California, Virginia, Colorado, Connecticut, Utah, or another state with a comprehensive privacy law, you may have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Know what personal information we collect, use, and share</li>
          <li>Access a copy of your personal information</li>
          <li>Correct inaccurate information</li>
          <li>Delete your personal information</li>
          <li>Opt out of the sale or sharing of your personal information</li>
          <li>Opt out of targeted advertising</li>
          <li>Non-discrimination for exercising these rights</li>
        </ul>
        <p>To exercise these rights, email <a href="mailto:robert@marketingperformance.net?subject=Privacy%20Rights%20Request">robert@marketingperformance.net</a> with the subject line "Privacy Rights Request."</p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>We retain personal information for as long as needed for the purposes described in this policy, unless a longer retention period is required by law. Form submissions are retained indefinitely unless you request deletion.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>7. Data Security</h2>
        <p>We use reasonable administrative, technical, and physical safeguards to protect your information. No system is perfectly secure, however, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>The Site is not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe a child has provided us information, contact us and we will delete it.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>9. International Visitors</h2>
        <p>The Site is operated in the United States. If you visit from outside the U.S., your information will be transferred to and processed in the U.S., where data protection laws may differ from those in your country.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will revise the "Last Updated" date at the top. Continued use of the Site after changes constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>11. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions, requests, or concerns:</p>
        <p class="legal-contact">
          <strong>Marketing Performance Group</strong><br/>
          Robert Butt, Founder<br/>
          <a href="mailto:robert@marketingperformance.net">robert@marketingperformance.net</a><br/>
          Columbia, South Carolina
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Base>

<style>
  /* ─── Top nav — matches site ─── */
  .mp-nav {
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
    backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .mp-nav-inner {
    max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 32px; height: 56px;
    display: flex; align-items: center;
  }
  .mp-logo {
    display: flex; align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px; text-decoration: none;
  }
  .mp-logo img { height: 44px; width: auto; display: block; }
  .mp-logo:hover { text-decoration: none; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .mp-logo img { height: 34px; }
  }

  /* ─── Legal page layout ─── */
  .legal {
    background: var(--canvas);
    padding: 64px 22px 96px;
  }
  .legal-doc {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--white);
    padding: 64px 56px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .legal-doc { padding: 40px 24px; }
  }

  .legal-head {
    padding-bottom: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .legal-eye {
    font-family: var(--font-t);
    font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue); margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .legal-h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-d);
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4.5vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.07;
    letter-spacing: -0.022em;
    color: var(--graphite); margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .legal-dates {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;
    font-family: var(--font-t);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--mid-gray);
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }
  .legal-dates strong {
    font-weight: 600; color: var(--graphite);
  }

  /* ─── Sections ─── */
  .legal-section { margin-bottom: 36px; }
  .legal-section:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .legal-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-d);
    font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.25; letter-spacing: -0.018em;
    color: var(--graphite);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .legal-section h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-d);
    font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--graphite);
    margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .legal-section p {
    font-family: var(--font-t);
    font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;
    letter-spacing: -0.018em;
    color: var(--graphite);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .legal-section p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .legal-section p strong { font-weight: 600; }
  .legal-section ul {
    list-style: none; padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;
  }
  .legal-section ul li {
    font-family: var(--font-t);
    font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55;
    letter-spacing: -0.018em;
    color: var(--graphite);
    padding-left: 18px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .legal-section ul li::before {
    content: "·";
    position: absolute;
    left: 6px; top: 0;
    color: var(--blue);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .legal-section ul li strong { font-weight: 600; }

  .legal-section a {
    color: var(--blue-link);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .legal-section a:hover { color: var(--blue); }

  .legal-section code {
    font-family: var(--font-m);
    font-size: 13px;
    background: var(--canvas);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: var(--graphite);
  }

  .legal-callout {
    background: rgba(0,113,227,0.05);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--blue);
    padding: 16px 20px;
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-family: var(--font-t);
    font-size: 15px !important;
    line-height: 1.55 !important;
    color: var(--graphite) !important;
  }

  .legal-contact {
    background: var(--canvas);
    padding: 20px 24px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--blue);
    font-family: var(--font-t);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
</style>
